Piece 5 — Frontend pages

- Auth pages (login, register — Google + email)
- Home page — restaurant list
- Restaurant/[id] — menu + add to cart
- Cart + checkout — place order
- Orders list + orders/[id] — LIVE tracking via Socket.io
- Restaurant dashboard — incoming orders live
- Delivery dashboard

Verify:
- Backend: change order status in worker → connected Socket.io client gets event
- Frontend: browse → cart → checkout → watch status update live without refresh

Guardrails: raw SQL via pg, TS throughout, learner comments in ordered Steps, no
